{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">圈中出名顧家的「廿四孝老公」關曜儁（Leo）與太太迎來拍拖10周年的大日子！為了好好慶祝這個重要里程碑，Leo 決定撇甩家中的寶貝，帶老婆過返個極致放鬆的二人世界。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"leokwan_1789272712_3985026673622306751_9763220.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026yAdQ64u7lf1789367913.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"leokwan_1789272712_3985026673622306751_9763220.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">平日忙於工作與湊小朋友的 Leo，坦言今次周年紀念並沒有安排密密麻麻的行程，唯一的目標就是「想大家好好有 Me Time 休息吓」！兩人罕有地享受沒有小朋友在身邊的時光，不但各自擁有充裕的私人時間，更久違地試了一次「自然醒」，令 Leo 都不禁大嗌：「好爽！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"leokwan_1789272713_3985026737811920464_9763220.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20264vBKAarAm91789367912.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"leokwan_1789272713_3985026737811920464_9763220.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/>這次的快閃休息之旅雖然安排得非常倉卒，但背後卻充滿著 Leo 對太太的濃濃愛意。他深知老婆自從生了三個小朋友之後，幾乎把所有心力都放在家庭上，「冇晒啲私人時間」，因此特意藉著 10 周年紀念，讓愛妻好好叉電喘息，盡顯貼心。這份「父母大解放」的真實感受，相信不少生了小孩的家長都深有體會。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"leokwan_1789272713_3985026743650226371_9763220.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026MhvMBuXYRP1789367913.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"leokwan_1789272713_3985026743650226371_9763220.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"leokwan_1789272713_3985026734800461182_9763220.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Aj8uvNQ8AU1789367912.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"leokwan_1789272713_3985026734800461182_9763220.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T08:21:14.881670+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}